"P3076981219" "Chemicals"
// DetailString :
"P2442890791" "These are chemicals stolen from the Council. Terrence Dobbs plans to use them for his pest control sprays."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2903904222" "So in my line of work, I always gotta be up on the latest tools of the trade. Pest control sprays, traps, high-powered rifles - y'know, the usual. Problem is I'm running low on some chemicals for my heavy-duty sprayer mix. And these chemicals - well let's just say ya can't find 'em at your local hardware store!<br><br>I been askin' around, and I found out the Council is shippin' in a load of the chemicals I'm lookin' for by boat! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need someone to intercept the shipment and steal these chemicals for me.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3715631677" "Steal chemical shipment"
// SendOffString :
"P2197395347" "I got a boat ready down at the docks. Head over the ship and steal those chemicals! Oh, and you'd best cover your tracks - take down the Council leader in charge of the shipment, too!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P391659143" "You get lost or somethin'? Head down to the docks and steal those chemicals for me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1899217356" "You pull up alongside the ship. Steal the chemicals for Dobbs!"

