// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3766456192" "So you think I'd have the local pest control market all locked up, right? There's this new guy named Charlie Biggs who has come to town and set up a rival extermination business! Now, I normally don't mind a bit of competition, but this guy is undercutting my prices by a huge margin. This won't stand!<br><br>I found out where the new guy is doing a job right now. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over there and 'persuade' him to take his business elsewhere!</A><br><br>So what you will about him, Biggs is a pretty heavy-duty exterminator. He might have a trick or two up his sleeve that'd even take you out, so you might want to grab a buddy to help you with this!"
// AcceptString :
"P1859138269" "Take down rival exterminator"
// SendOffString :
"P3367674003" ""Tell that bum to stay outta the Rogue Isles!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3959247379" "What are waitin' for?  Take down Charlie Biggs!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2600872084" "You hear the skittering of Arachnoids in the distance. Find Biggs and run him out of town!"

